[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:71. He's Awful]
[00:01.640]Lesson 71. | 第71课。
[00:03.635]What's Ron Marston like, Pauline? | 宝琳，罗恩·马斯顿怎么样？
[00:07.130]He's awful. | 他糟透了。
[00:08.685]He telephoned me four times yesterday | 他昨天给我打了四次电话
[00:11.845]and three times the day before yesterday. | 前天打了三次。
[00:15.545]He telephoned the office yesterday morning | 他昨天早上给办公室打电话了
[00:19.010]and yesterday afternoon. | 昨天下午也打了。
[00:21.090]My boss answered the telephone. | 我老板接的电话。
[00:23.775]What did your boss say to him? | 你老板对他说了什么？
[00:26.260]He said, | 他说：
[00:27.340]Miss White is typing letters. | “怀特小姐正在打信。
[00:29.690]She can't speak to you now. | 她现在不能和你说话。”
[00:32.570]Then I arrived home at 6 o'clock yesterday evening. | 然后我昨天晚上六点到家。
[00:37.520]He telephoned again. | 他又打电话了。
[00:39.780]But I didn't answer the phone. | 但我没接电话。
[00:42.710]Did he telephone again last night? | 他昨晚又打电话了吗？
[00:46.110]Yes, he did. | 是的，他打了。
[00:47.910]He telephoned at 9 o'clock. | 他九点钟打的电话。
[00:50.950]What did you say to him? | 你对他说了什么？
[00:53.425]I said, | 我说：
[00:54.600]this is Pauline's mother. | “我是宝琳的妈妈。
[00:56.775]Please don't telephone my daughter again. | 请不要再给我女儿打电话了。”
[01:00.570]Did he telephone again? | 他又打电话了吗？
[01:03.070]No, he didn't. | 不，他没有。